## v2.1 — Observability & DevTools 🔬

Production monitoring and developer experience.

### Metrics
- [ ] `GET /metrics` — Prometheus-compatible endpoint
  - Events emitted/sec
  - Route latency histograms (P50/P95/P99)
  - Error rates by event type
  - WebSocket client count
  - SQLite query time
- [ ] Grafana dashboard template

### Tracing
- [ ] OpenTelemetry integration
- [ ] Trace ID propagation through route steps
- [ ] Distributed tracing across chained events

### Dashboard v2
- [ ] Route execution visualizer (animated flow diagram)
- [ ] SQLite table browser with inline editing
- [ ] Event replay controls
- [ ] Performance graphs (throughput, latency, errors over time)
- [ ] Manifest editor with live validation
- [ ] Dark/light theme toggle

### CLI Enhancements
- [ ] `spine init` — generate a starter `app.spine` interactively
- [ ] `spine dev` — start server + dashboard in one command
- [ ] `spine logs` — tail server logs with colored output
- [ ] `spine benchmark` — built-in load testing
- [ ] `spine export` — dump SQLite tables as JSON/CSV
- [ ] `spine migrate` — diff two manifests and apply DB changes

