## v3.0 — Spine Cloud ☁️

Managed Spine as a service.

### Deployment
- [ ] `spine deploy` — one-command deploy to Spine Cloud
- [ ] Auto-provisioned SQLite → managed Postgres migration
- [ ] Custom domains + TLS
- [ ] Environment variables management

### Collaboration
- [ ] Team workspaces
- [ ] Manifest version history with diff view
- [ ] Staging → Production promotion flow
- [ ] Role-based access control

### Scale
- [ ] Horizontal auto-scaling
- [ ] Edge deployment (multi-region)
- [ ] Event queue with guaranteed delivery
- [ ] Rate limiting per client/event

